Standard Ebooks publications (https://standardebooks.org) for the e-book
tests (test/doc/epub.zig): The Strange Case of Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde,
The Importance of Being Earnest (drama), and Alice's Adventures in
Wonderland (verse, illustrations). The texts are in the public domain in
the United States; Standard Ebooks dedicates its markup, CSS, and
production to the public domain (CC0 1.0). Images were removed to keep
the repository small; everything else is as published.
